oto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> Negative </text></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(19580,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> Positive </text></g></g></g><line data-line=\"v\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"2905\" y1=\"-3475\" x2=\"2905\" y2=\"3975\"></line><line data-line=\"v\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"11575\" y1=\"-3475\" x2=\"11575\" y2=\"3975\"></line><line data-line=\"v\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"19045\" y1=\"-3475\" x2=\"19045\" y2=\"3975\"></line><line data-line=\"h\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"895\" x2=\"26150\" y2=\"895\"></line><line data-line=\"h\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"-575\" x2=\"26150\" y2=\"-575\"></line><line data-line=\"h\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"-2045\" x2=\"26150\" y2=\"-2045\"></line><rect data-frame=\"true\" class=\"mjx-solid\" width=\"26080\" height=\"7380\" x=\"35\" y=\"-3440\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nA, B and C are respectively :",
